line 9: {{< details >}}: name each value, as in summary="…".
line 13: {{< /tabs >}} closes nothing.
line 15: {{< tab >}} goes inside {{< tabs >}}.
line 20: Inside {{< tabs >}}, put content in a {{< tab label="…" >}}.
line 26: The image "https://example.com/x.png" was left out: upload it to Media and use its Markdown.
line 28: {{< youtube >}}: a quoted value has no closing quote.
line 30: {{< details >}} has no closing {{< /details >}}, so it runs to the end.
